      "id": "35040857-0c12-4a97-ad25-cc3c0cb2cb1f",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Telegram Bot Authentication System\n\nThis template contains two distinct components: a reusable authentication sub-workflow and an example parent workflow.\n\n## 1. Authentication Sub-Workflow (Gatekeeper)\nThis is a microservice designed to validate Telegram users against a Supabase database before allowing access to a premium bot.\n* **Input:** Expects a `Telegram` payload and workflow `context` (ID) from the parent workflow.\n* **Process:** Queries the database using the user's Telegram ID. Evaluates their `status` (approved, pending, rejected), `is_locked` state, and `allowed_workflows`.\n* **Output:** Returns a structured JSON response containing `is_authorized` (boolean) and a localized `message` string.\n* **Setup:** Update the `bot_username` variable in the \"Set User Preferences\" node to match your dedicated onboarding/auth bot.\n\n## 2. Parent Workflow (Implementation Mockup)\nThis demonstrates how to protect your main AI agents using the authentication gatekeeper. \n* **Trigger:** Receives the standard Telegram user message.\n* **Data Prep:** Maps the incoming payload and workflow context to send to the sub-workflow.\n* **Validation:** An `If` node evaluates the `is_authorized` boolean returned by the gatekeeper.\n* **Unauthorized Route (`true` branch):** Automatically sends the pre-formatted status message (e.g., pending, locked, unregistered) back to the user via Telegram.\n* **Authorized Route (`false` branch):** Routes to the placeholder. **Action Required:** Delete the \"Replace Me\" node and build your actual AI agent logic here.\n\n##Database Schema\n\n```\n-- 1. Create the ENUMs for strict control\nCREATE TYPE access_status AS ENUM ('pending', 'approved', 'rejected');\nCREATE TYPE user_role AS ENUM ('admin', 'viewer', 'client');\n\n-- 2. Create the primary users table\nCREATE TABLE users (\n  telegram_id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,\n  username TEXT UNIQUE, \n  full_name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  reason_for_access TEXT,\n  status access_status DEFAULT 'pending',\n  allowed_workflows TEXT[] DEFAULT '{}',\n  metadata JSONB DEFAULT '{}'::jsonb,\n  is_locked BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,\n  role user_role DEFAULT 'client',\n  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW(),\n  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()\n);\n```",
        "height": 1568,
        "width": 848
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1200,
        80
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "b266bd92-88e7-426e-bdb9-c8cabc22742f",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
